5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to protect the low barrier for new members.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I worry about the administrative load on the treasurer.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I want to see who actually shows up regularly.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The hesitation to commit is the real problem here.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We cannot guess the costs again. We need hard numbers.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, yes, but the data must not expose individual habits.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shunichi, hesitation often comes from fear of hidden work.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the work is visible if we look at the rota.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, the rota shows duty, not desire. I want the vibe.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, aggregate data is safe. I need the ledger and renewals.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the sign-up records for mid-year joiners.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the treasurer's logged hours and the ledger.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will review the sign-in sheets and the attendance record.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the winter social and the taster forms.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will check the bank statements and the last year's ledger.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
