35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The data confirms it. Eleven mid-year joiners needed hand-worked calculations.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,I found the ledger. Fixed costs are seventy percent.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The sign-in sheets show a quarter of us do two-thirds of the work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Benjamin, that fixed cost is the wall people fear.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, seventy percent fixed means we need steady cash flow.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, exactly. The fear is the commitment, not the money.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, steady cash flow is good, but chasing it is bad.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the nine who work are the ones who stay.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, the nine who work are the ones who feel trapped.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, I saw the bank statements. A third needed reminders.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, reminders are a sign of friction. We need less friction.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, friction is what burns out the treasurer.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, if we recognize the work, the trap feels lighter.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, recognition is nice, but it does not change the bill.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, less friction means we need a structure that collects early.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
