60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is the only one that keeps the door open.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Option A is the only one that lets the treasurer sleep.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option B is the only one that respects the nine who work.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option C is the only one that lets people leave without guilt.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
